Author: Artem Lavrukhin <lavryha4590@gmail.com>
Description: Expose the SxS path of a native COM server.
 CDEX needs to keep the DLL implementing a COM class loaded after activation.
 Looking up the class in the global registry can select a different Wine DLL
 when the active SxS assembly supplies its own implementation.
 .
 Export a Wine function that resolves the class to its SxS DLL path, allowing
 CDEX to keep the same implementation loaded without reading Wine internals.
Last-Modified: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:35:06 +0300

